      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/easy",
      ":question/problem": "What is the sum of the leading entries of the $1\\text{st}$ and $2\\text{nd}$ rows in the matrix $A,$ given below?\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 2 & 5 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -3 & 7 \\\\ 4 & 0 & 6 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 6\\end{bmatrix}\n$$",
